{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_st01",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_st01",
  "title": "喚醒噩夢",
  "storyCode": "SV-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e78d2d4cb283a5863155ad4fbc8449af64deda4dce5f51673f0e5b81458a81d5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibchurch"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快快，請進，請進。我知道你會來這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該怎麼解釋呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到哪裡都會背著那個箱子嗎，吟遊歌手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你介意我再問個問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這箱子裡裝的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩克斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，真不錯，薩克斯......吹奏樂器嗎。不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是否有幸聽聽它的音色？音樂......這座城市已經許多年沒有音樂響起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不，抱歉......我忽然想到，吟遊歌手要拿報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可難住我了，您看，恐怕我拿不出什麼賞錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "且看這座老建築。哼，打理它是件相當困難的事，貨幣在這裡代表不了什麼，沒人收集，也沒人用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也有提供一頓午餐的餘力。吟遊歌手，怎麼樣？你願不願意隨便演奏點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請你吃頓飽飯這種事我還算是能做到的，雖然也不是什麼美味佳餚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你沉默不語的樣子......啊，會不會是這樣：比起音樂，你更喜歡舞蹈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，你還穿著舞裙......有天賦的人。我們可太久沒在這見到你這樣光彩照人的朋友了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......肉麻。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如果要聽什麼，當時你就可以讓我唱。不用到這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來是要問一個問題。你身邊站著的這個人可能知道，現在我覺得你也脫不了關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的，這位——熟人，過去和你認識嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自然認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有問你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我不知道這個人是不是我當初認識的那個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個，也是正常的。人都是會變的。海水拍打陸地，假以時日也能讓海岸變成沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你來這裡，不是她讓你來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不是你讓我來的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "僅僅是我讓你來，你是不會來這裡的，對吧。我只是個陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是問，她有沒有讓你來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。我是自己來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你沒有說謊。我能聽出謊言......但你是誠實的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問這問那，我卻什麼都還沒說，你怎麼能這麼討人厭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消氣，消氣，歌手。我不是故意的。謹慎一點對我們都有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我來問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座城市裡的人很信任你，但是，在海岸上發生的那些事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕對不正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乞食。恐魚。海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是哪裡人？你是不是知道些什麼？你和她對我隱瞞了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，哈哈。是的，我知道的比別人確實要多一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，我知道有人想見你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見我？因為我是個吟遊歌手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在乎音樂的是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這聽上去有些荒唐，但想見你的其實不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想見你的是我的一位朋友。應他要求，我才邀請你來到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？他想見我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨我來吧。見到他你就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟......你也有一位朋友在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請走這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也來。賞賜你的時候也到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，我就不點燈了，不過這對你也沒什麼難度吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說吟遊歌手大多數身手也不錯，城市和荒野都不太友善，出遠門的人很容易遭災，一定得學一身保護自己的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錢財買不到音樂，音樂卻可以當貨幣，只要唱得一首好歌，到哪裡都餓不死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前也很嚮往這種生活，可能因為我並不擅長這些吧......一旦在哪紮下根，我就很難再離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcave"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們難道在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，在海底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽靈鯊的身體漂浮在水缸之中，像是死了，又或者是睡熟了。\n多少想法在斯卡蒂腦中閃過。\n她為什麼在這？是歌蕾蒂婭做的嗎？如果幽靈鯊死了呢？歌蕾蒂婭怎麼會允許幽靈鯊被殺？！難道她真的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就是你的朋友，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是叫斯卡蒂嗎？你的事不是我在跟。他們把你處理得很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是你身邊的人。他們處理得很好，讓你的精神狀態保持在這種感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近他們沒空管你，但拜你這位隊長所賜，你到了這裡，簡直是送給我的禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然是你先走上前......而不是那個歌手。你在等什麼？之前你為什麼沒有殺我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會有那麼愚蠢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些孽物，從來都這個樣子......自我感覺良好，又言之無物。這個試驗品，她的生命在這裡消失，也無所謂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認過成果讓你心安。你滿意的神情溢於言表，卻也不讓我看你帶她去了哪裡。那麼你還不能讓她死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們幾個裡，她的生命一定是你最看重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我毀掉了你們那麼多試驗場地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果真是你做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——幽靈鯊很寶貴。你對深海獵人實施源石感染性的測試，就只有這一個樣本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陸生牲畜的原罪能在你們這些孽物身上起效，不是很有趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然......我們三人的試驗場真的被你毀掉太多了。投入了如此大量的、精煉過的液化源石，用上了阿戈爾的技術......都不能再復現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她確實很寶貴。我只是想不通她怎麼能對抗如此規模的源石感染......她的脊髓，經過稀釋，也夠感染一個小國。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在不一樣了，謝謝你把她送到我手裡，孽物。我會領先另外兩人......我會發現你們最後的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會證明自己的成就。我的研究。我們敵人的秘密。以及弱點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會先死在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我留你一命，證明了你是那個人。不值得留著的我已經處決掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然證明了你和他們，和這個實驗的牽連，那你也不用活下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深海教會......你是深海教會的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我允許你這麼稱呼我了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太能藏了。你們每個人都不一樣。什麼話都會說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊之所以會變得瘋瘋癲癲......也是因為你們的灌輸和折磨嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面那些人，你利用了那些人。你也在把他們當試驗品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "投海的人......都成了你實驗的犧牲品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放肆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大海的施捨可不是什麼利用。這是救濟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以放著他們不管，他們會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海洋給他們食物，給他們不願活著的人自由活下去的新生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些孽物又怎麼能理解......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以了，主教。我表現出來關心你目的的態度了嗎？如果你會錯意了，請你立刻忘記。你醜陋的行徑涸墨難書，我只關心你的遺毒還能漂流多遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到這裡就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為你多帶一個人......就可以穩勝我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和你的同類一樣自信——一樣愚蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們有些人選擇成為恐魚這件事，我已經知道了。這恐怕不能成為底牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使你能變成一隻海嗣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二隊長！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "憑歌蕾蒂婭的速度，她能在聲音傳來之前躲開。\n但是，前提是，歌蕾蒂婭想躲。\n歌蕾蒂婭並沒有意識到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，呵呵......（嗆血的聲音）......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gla-dia。他的請求如此。我這麼做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。我想見你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多年的沉浮。好多年的游動。好多生死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愚蠢的孽物。如果不是使者需要你，你們這些孽物早就死在灘頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混蛋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "使者，早點解決這個問題吧。看著這些侵害我們海洋的人，我總覺得噁心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這麼想攻擊她們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們這些東西，阿戈爾創造出來的雜種，殺了我們多少同胞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是——不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我先問完這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我的姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐妹，你現在也不清楚自己從哪裡來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來自阿戈爾，怪物......我是你的天敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我給你真相吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們就是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你流著我們的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扯謊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "使者，你......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isha-mla。 你的血是我們的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們肉體在那，然後我們的血進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有許多血親。他們遇見你們。他們死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們聞見你們氣味。就像你聞見我們氣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們以為同胞困在你們皮底。他們不顧危險撕咬你們皮肉，他們想從你們囊泡裡把自己同胞釋放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還沒有準備好，他們那時還沒有器官去瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們沒有在體內困住同胞。你們就是我們同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。你就是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會喚醒你。你會想起那種感覺。阿戈爾人的身體脆弱，事物過去太快。我會幫你找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下。停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你，想知道。我知道你想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們殺害我們阿戈爾人......現在又想來和我沾親帶故？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的血與你的血相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聞到我們氣味，正如我們聞見你氣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們找到我們，殺死我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不懂時，我們也殺死你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們餵養海洋。我們的屍體供養了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我們擁有同個故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們殺了我的家人。是你們殺了我的媽媽，我的奶奶，我的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不去阿戈爾城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼多的城市都被你們毀了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些城市在我們領地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，即使在阿戈爾腹地的城市，也會有人被你們捕獵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不這麼做。在城市死去無法供養族群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈爾人攻擊我們，我們攻擊阿戈爾人。沒有區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們領地裡的人的死，是你領地裡的人做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說謊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說謊？我想知道說謊的意思。“扯謊”，剛才你也說了。我想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，你和我們間的阻隔太強。你沒有辦法把想法傳給我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能知道我們所想，這也夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的身體生長，能夠說語言，能和你交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "語言臃腫，不好使用，我只能這樣說，但是這樣你就能告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我為見你而來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你時常感覺，周圍活物，與你陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在游動時，能夠感到海水方向，也能知道沒有光的海裡的各種事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有些時候睡下，感到自己與大群同游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你為什麼要說。為什麼要說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回憶起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼......之前沒有......為什麼我們沒能看出來？！我們為什麼查不出？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。 我有問題要問，Ishar-mla。抬起頭來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我殺了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我殺了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我殺了祂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂什麼都沒做，而我......我卻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就連我的......我的妹妹......也是......阿戈爾人......阿戈爾人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的罪惡......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，不要疑惑。我們沒有罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是做了你會做的事，Ishar-mla，同胞做的沒罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我替阿戈爾......我們殺了那麼多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認為自己是阿戈爾，那麼你殺也對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把其他人當做血親，所以你那麼做，我們不知道，我們攻擊你們的時候你那麼做，也對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——Ishar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈爾，無鱗，你們語言裡才有“罪”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為生存做，都是對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有錯。所以你知道的都可說，我們沒有願意，只有說和不說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會問問題。說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。在你們的攻擊下，我們失去了和它之間的聯繫，密切的聯繫。我們只能感受到它的搏動，沒法聽到它聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們最後一次同游，最後一次一起攻擊，就是那時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當它在你面前又一次沉眠時，你有沒有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽到它說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你？！使者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。只能下次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（體液堵塞的聲音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gla-dia......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗚咽一樣的聲音）......你很健壯，Gla-dia。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "垃圾。（阿戈爾語）對你我不會有一絲禮貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿戈爾語）獵物就該乖乖......困在陷阱裡慘叫。你才是獵物，垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐妹......你信號的傳遞......密集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情緒。恨。獵物怎麼會懂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛。恨。痛苦。悲傷。歡樂。欣慰。在你們看來都無用。你們覺得這是渣碎......是不必要的東西，是贅餘，是不是?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒有你說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼你就更不會懂，垃圾。我們寧可身有贅餘也要那樣活下去。我們不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gla-dia。情緒。真是很強的情緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你連歌都不會唱。死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼——怎麼會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼她的身體能從那種傷害中恢復？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
